d","What","Where","Who"]},{"n":32,"type":"mcq","section":"B","prompt":"Look! These are my new ___.","options":["shoe","shoes","shoeses","a shoes"]}],"reading":{"instruction":"Lis le texte et réponds en anglais.","text":"Hi! I'm Nina. I'm eleven. I live in a small house with my parents and my baby brother, Leo. I have a cat. Her name is Bella. She is black and white. Every morning, I walk to school with my friend Sara. My favourite subject is science. After school, I play in the garden or I read a book.","questions":[{"n":33,"type":"open","prompt":"How old is Nina?"},{"n":34,"type":"open","prompt":"Who is Leo?"},{"n":35,"type":"open","prompt":"What colour is Bella?"},{"n":36,"type":"open","prompt":"How does Nina go to school?"},{"n":37,"type":"open","prompt":"Who does she go to school with?"},{"n":38,"type":"open","prompt":"What is her favourite subject?"},{"n":39,"type":"tf","prompt":"Nina lives in a big house.","options":["True","False"]},{"n":40,"type":"open","prompt":"What does Nina do after school? (one thing)"}]}},{"id":"ENF-P3","palier":3,"items":[{"n":41,"type":"gap","section":"A","prompt":"Yesterday I ___ (go) to the zoo."},{"n":42,"type":"gap","section":"A","prompt":"We ___ (watch) a film last night."},{"n":43,"type":"gap","section":"A","prompt":"Look! The baby ___ (sleep)."},{"n":44,"type":"gap","section":"A","prompt":"An elephant is ___ (big) than a dog."},{"n":45,"type":"gap","section":"A","prompt":"She ___ (not / come) to school yesterday."},{"n":46,"type":"gap","section":"A","prompt":"He is the ___ (fast) runner in our class."},{"n":47,"type":"gap","section":"A","prompt":"Did you ___ (see) the match?"},{"n":48,"type":"gap","section":"A","prompt":"I'm going ___ visit my grandma tomorrow."},{"n":49,"type":"mcq","section":"B","prompt":"There aren't ___ apples left.","options":["some","any","much","a"]},{"n":50,"type":"mcq","section":"B","prompt":"You ___ run in the classroom. It's dangerous!","options":["must","mustn't","can","don't"]},{"n":51,"type":"mcq","section":"B","prompt":"What ___ you do last weekend?","options":["do","did","does","are"]},{"n":52,"type":"mcq","section":"B","prompt":"I have never ___ a lion.","options":["see","saw","seen","seeing"]}],"reading":{"instruction":"Lis l’histoire et réponds en anglais.","text":"Last Saturday, Kofi and his dad went to the market to buy a present for his mum's birthday. First, they looked at some shoes, but they were too expensive. Then Kofi saw a beautiful blue scarf. It was cheap, and Kofi knew that blue was his mum's favourite colour. When they got home, Kofi wrapped the present and hid it under his bed. On Sunday morning, his mum opened it and smiled. \"It's perfect!\" she said.","questions":[{"n":53,"type":"open","prompt":"When did Kofi and his dad go to the market?"},{"n":54,"type":"open","prompt":"Why did they go to the market?"},{"n":55,"type":"open","prompt":"Why didn't they buy the shoes?"},{"n":56,"type":"open","prompt":"What did Kofi see?"},{"n":57,"type":"open","prompt":"Why did Kofi choose it?"},{"n":58,"type":"open","prompt":"Where did he hide the present?"},{"n":59,"type":"open","prompt":"When did his mum open it?"},{"n":60,"type":"tf","prompt":"The scarf was expensive.","options":["True","False"]}]}}],"writing":{"minutes":10,"minWords":0,"maxWords":80,"prompt":["Write about you: your name, your age, your family, what you like, and what you did yesterday.","Example: My name is Paul. I am ten years old. I have one sister. I like football."]},"oral":{"minutes":5}}